{"title":"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem C","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> be TNYWR.<br />\nThe lines with equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dad67f07090b95b6ca3a2df8c02b48e905e885ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c768b84447274642b96205755bcaa239f8c62350.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2x + t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" /> intersect at the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e24c43456d95b5ab8d4f2f8f85a644e98b7ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can set the two equations equal to each other to see where they intersect and set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23f79218243495086a8f3e33da5bec30b8865c2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 = 2a + t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/e/36e4a72c4bb25c96e6224846b86274a5a62539aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 12 - t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/8/bf8256a0277e2380bbbf761752b92efdf2fccd9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{12 - t}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_B\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem B\">seat B</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/b/43bd47437fcfb3ef1dd71dfad3088015d0c27577.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />. This means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ff987f6b79edce4154cadaec10cf1ea07bc59d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{12 - 4}{2} = \\frac{8}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"126\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/c/9bc96d59cbe5aa8e65e3231999d0ef65197077c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=